      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "There is a correlation between the plasma concentrations of glycerol trinitrate and the antianginal effects of trinitrolong (application on the gingival mucosa) and nitroderm-TTS (application on the skin) in patients with angina pectoris by Hill's formula. The lower limit on the gingival mucosa) and nitroderm-TTS is 0.5-0.6 ng/ml."},
